---
import ManagerLayout from '../../layouts/ManagerLayout.astro';
import ManagerAccess from '../../components/ManagerAccess.astro';
---
<ManagerLayout title="Склад" active="stock"><section data-workspace="stock"><header class="dash-header"><div><p class="dash-eyebrow">Остатки и движения</p><h1>Склад</h1></div><button type="button" class="dash-button" data-workspace-refresh>Обновить</button></header><ManagerAccess/><div data-workspace-content hidden>
<div class="mgr-filter-panel"><label class="dash-field mgr-search">Найти исполнение<input data-inventory-search type="search" placeholder="Артикул, товар или исполнение"/></label><label class="dash-field">Порог низкого остатка<select data-inventory-threshold>{[0,1,3,5,10,20,50,100].map(v=><option value={v} selected={v===3}>{v} шт.</option>)}</select></label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-inventory-low/>Только низкий остаток</label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-inventory-demo/>Демонстрационные</label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-inventory-archived/>Архивные</label></div>
<section class="dash-panel"><div class="dash-section-head"><h2>Физические исполнения</h2><span data-inventory-count></span></div><table class="dash-table mgr-record-table mgr-inventory-table"><thead><tr><th>Исполнение</th><th class="dash-number">На складе</th><th class="dash-number">Резерв</th><th class="dash-number">Свободно</th><th>Действия</th></tr></thead><tbody data-inventory-list></tbody></table><p class="dash-empty" data-inventory-empty hidden>Исполнения по этим условиям не найдены.</p><nav class="mgr-pagination" data-inventory-pagination aria-label="Страницы склада"></nav></section>
<p class="dash-help mgr-bottom-note">У комплектов нет собственного остатка: доступность рассчитывается по составляющим. Корректировка не может уменьшить физический остаток ниже резерва.</p>
<dialog class="mgr-dialog" data-stock-dialog aria-labelledby="stock-dialog-title"><div class="mgr-dialog-head"><h2 id="stock-dialog-title" data-stock-dialog-title></h2><button type="button" class="dash-button" data-close-stock aria-label="Закрыть окно">Закрыть</button></div><p class="dash-help" data-stock-dialog-item></p><p class="notice error" data-stock-error role="alert" hidden></p><div data-stock-form-box><p class="notice" data-stock-current></p><form data-stock-operation data-edit-form class="commerce-form"><label class="field" data-stock-amount-label>Количество, шт.<input type="number" name="amount" step="1" min="1" max="100000" required/></label><label class="field">Причина<input name="reason" minlength="3" maxlength="500" required placeholder="Например: поступление партии"/></label><button class="button" type="submit" data-save-stock>Сохранить</button></form></div><div data-stock-history-box hidden><p class="dash-help" data-stock-history-status></p><div data-stock-history-list></div><nav class="mgr-pagination" data-stock-history-pagination aria-label="Страницы движений"></nav></div></dialog>
</div></section><script>import '../../scripts/manager-stock';</script></ManagerLayout>
